Terminals unused in grammar

    COMMENTLINE
    CMD_OPTION


Grammar

    0 $accept: spice $end

    1 spice: netlist end

    2 end: end EOL
    3    | END

    4 netlist: netlist line
    5        | line

    6 line: component EOL
    7     | command EOL
    8     | EOL
    9     | error EOL

   10 component: resistor
   11          | capacitor
   12          | inductor
   13          | vccs
   14          | vs
   15          | vcvs
   16          | cs
   17          | cccs
   18          | ccvs

   19 command: print
   20        | dc
   21        | ac
   22        | tran
   23        | op
   24        | plot

   25 resistor: RESISTOR node node value

   26 capacitor: CAPACITOR node node value

   27 inductor: INDUCTOR node node value

   28 vccs: VCCS node node node node value

   29 vs: VS node node
   30   | VS node node value
   31   | vs RK_DC value
   32   | vs RK_AC value

   33 vcvs: VCVS node node node node value

   34 cs: CS node node value

   35 cccs: CCCS node node VS value

   36 ccvs: CCVS node node VS value

   37 op: CMD_OP

   38 dc: CMD_DC
   39   | dc VS value value value
   40   | dc CS value value value

   41 ac: CMD_AC RK_DEC value value value
   42   | CMD_AC RK_LIN value value value
   43   | CMD_AC RK_OCT value value value

   44 tran: CMD_TRAN value
   45     | CMD_TRAN value value
   46     | CMD_TRAN value value value

   47 print: CMD_PRINT RK_AC
   48      | CMD_PRINT RK_DC
   49      | CMD_PRINT RK_OP
   50      | CMD_PRINT RK_TRAN
   51      | print VAR_V
   52      | print VAR_I

   53 plot: CMD_PLOT RK_AC
   54     | CMD_PLOT RK_DC
   55     | CMD_PLOT RK_OP
   56     | CMD_PLOT RK_TRAN
   57     | plot VAR_V
   58     | plot VAR_I

   59 node: STRING
   60     | INTEGER
   61     | RESISTOR
   62     | CAPACITOR
   63     | INDUCTOR
   64     | VS
   65     | VCCS

   66 value: VALUE
   67      | FLOAT
   68      | INTEGER


